 "name_en": "Transportation Execution (6W3)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Transportation Execution (6W3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">You execute and track the transportation process for your freight documents. You can set the relevant statuses to track the arrival and departure at your locations and set the checkout status to enable freight cost confirmation. You can set statuses for the entire document, as well as for individual stages and locations.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor the execution of freight documents (such as road freight order, rail freight order, ocean freight booking, air freight booking, and advanced intercompany documents) created in your transportation process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set relevant statuses to track relevant freight documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set the checkout status to enable the freight cost confirmation for involved freight documents</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <div class=\"p\">\n       <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">Support your company's transportation execution in SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">Increase efficiency through seamless integration between transportation management and warehouse operations</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">Improve supply chain visibility by accurate status reporting</li>\n       </ul>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__additional_license\">\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>运输执行 (6W3)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">执行并跟踪货运凭证的运输流程。您可以设置相关状态以跟踪地点的运达和启运，并设置检出状态以启用货运成本确认。可以为整个凭证以及各个阶段和位置设置状态。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">监控在运输流程中创建的货运凭证（例如公路货运订单、铁路货运订单、海运预订、空运预订和高级公司间凭证）的执行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">设置相关状态以跟踪相关货运凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">设置检出状态，以启用相关货运凭证的货运成本确认</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <div class=\"p\">\n       <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">在 SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition 中支持公司的运输执行。</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">通过运输管理和仓库运营之间的无缝集成，提高效率</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">通过准确的状态报告提高供应链可视性</li>\n       </ul>\n      </div>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiob7ef8b8faa10491892c889c198f59d82__additional_license\">\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
